nodes.body:
Reproduced on vLLM 0.29.0 and 0.32.0; 0.23.0 passes. This causes incorrect outputs with native FlashInfer attention and calibrated FP8 KV cache, including our Qwen 3.8 27B FP8 setup.

On 0.32.0, this fix restores correct results in nine fast serving checks and a native attention numerical test.

@gaoxiaomo could you, please, rebase and get this approved/pushed? Otherwise, I’ve prepared an adaptation for current main preserving the NVFP4 guards; CPU dtype and lint checks pass. Would you prefer updating this PR or a replacement crediting the original author? Happy to help with the rebase.

